@startuml DBQuery
title ZTF_J2EE - Diagrama de Classes da Camada de Banco de Dados (JDBC)

package "database" {
    class DBConnection {
        - {static} Map<String, Connection> INSTANCES
        + {static} getStaticConnection(): Connection
        + {static} getStaticConnection(String connectionName): Connection
        + {static} openConnection(): Connection
        + {static} setConnection(String name, Connection conn): void
        + {static} closeAll(): void
    }

    class DBQuery {
        - String tableName
        - String fields
        - List<Condition> conditions
        - List<String> joins
        - List<Object> bindings
        - String orderByClause
        - String limitClause
        - Connection db
        + DBQuery(String table, String fields, Connection db)
        + addCondition(String logical, String column, String operator, Object value): DBQuery
        + addIn(String logical, String column, Collection<?> values): DBQuery
        + addJoin(String type, String tableOrAlias, String key, String operator, String foreignTable, String foreignKey): DBQuery
        + joinRaw(String joinClause): DBQuery
        + orderBy(String column, String direction): DBQuery
        + limit(int limit, int offset): DBQuery
        + buildWhere(): String
        + getSelectSql(): String
        + getBindings(): List<Object>
        + select(): List<Map<String, Object>>
        + first(): Map<String, Object>
        + insert(Map<String, Object> data): long
        + update(Map<String, Object> data): int
        + delete(): int
    }
}

DBQuery --> DBConnection : getStaticConnection() (conexao compartilhada)

note right of DBConnection
  getStaticConnection(): uma conexao por nome, compartilhada
  por todas as requisicoes (sem transacao).
  openConnection(): conexao nova e exclusiva, usada com
  try-with-resources em operacoes transacionais
  (ex.: models.RecuperacaoSenha).
end note
@enduml
